1
00:01:00,640 --> 00:01:01,359
Brother Gang,

2
00:01:02,119 --> 00:01:03,200
regarding Second Master,

3
00:01:03,240 --> 00:01:04,879
does he still refuse to see us?

4
00:01:08,079 --> 00:01:10,319
I've contacted seven or eight middlemen

5
00:01:10,760 --> 00:01:12,120
and tried to meet him countless times,

6
00:01:12,840 --> 00:01:14,040
but he won't even pick up the phone.

7
00:01:16,519 --> 00:01:18,239
Calm down, Brother Gang.

8
00:01:18,400 --> 00:01:19,680
Don't get so worked up.

9
00:01:21,760 --> 00:01:22,719
Even if

10
00:01:22,719 --> 00:01:24,760
things don't work out with Second Master,

11
00:01:25,400 --> 00:01:26,480
our company

12
00:01:26,640 --> 00:01:28,120
still has other options,

13
00:01:28,719 --> 00:01:29,280
right?

14
00:01:30,400 --> 00:01:31,879
Yet Xu Xiaoli

15
00:01:32,200 --> 00:01:34,640
really is my last lifeline.

16
00:01:37,920 --> 00:01:38,560
Of course,

17
00:01:39,680 --> 00:01:40,640
that Shen Jialing

18
00:01:40,640 --> 00:01:41,799
thinks cutting ties with me

19
00:01:42,040 --> 00:01:43,159
can finish me off.

20
00:01:44,760 --> 00:01:46,319
I've had a backup plan all along.

21
00:01:48,359 --> 00:01:49,319
However,

22
00:01:49,799 --> 00:01:52,120
Cloud Summit is watching me too closely,

23
00:01:52,400 --> 00:01:54,000
and as the Legal Representative,

24
00:01:55,439 --> 00:01:57,000
I'm bound by too many regulations,

25
00:01:57,359 --> 00:01:58,439
which ties my hands.

26
00:02:00,040 --> 00:02:00,799
Qianqian,

27
00:02:01,400 --> 00:02:02,680
I've thought this through for a long time.

28
00:02:04,200 --> 00:02:06,319
I must hand the company over

29
00:02:07,120 --> 00:02:08,000
to the person I trust

30
00:02:08,919 --> 00:02:10,599
and am closest to, to act as my proxy.

31
00:02:14,439 --> 00:02:15,680
After careful thought,

32
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:22,080
the only person I can truly trust now...

33
00:02:24,439 --> 00:02:25,360
is you.

34
00:02:31,439 --> 00:02:32,199
Brother Gang...

35
00:02:32,439 --> 00:02:33,800
You mean...

36
00:02:36,759 --> 00:02:38,639
Once you sign the contract,

37
00:02:40,080 --> 00:02:41,680
you will be Zhao's Construction's

38
00:02:42,199 --> 00:02:43,120
Legal Representative

39
00:02:43,120 --> 00:02:44,280
and General Manager.

40
00:02:45,280 --> 00:02:46,840
Consider this my betrothal gift to you.

41
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:54,280
From now on, whoever looked down on you,

42
00:02:54,960 --> 00:02:56,719
especially that Shen Jialing,

43
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:58,639
will have to show you respect

44
00:02:58,639 --> 00:03:00,439
and politely address you as

45
00:03:01,240 --> 00:03:01,919
"President Zhou."

46
00:03:07,560 --> 00:03:08,680
Thank you, Brother Gang!

47
00:03:08,960 --> 00:03:11,280
I'll protect the company for you.

48
00:03:15,919 --> 00:03:17,120
Ma Dawei,

49
00:03:18,039 --> 00:03:20,680
who cares about your relocation money?

50
00:03:21,560 --> 00:03:23,960
I'm now the boss of a major corporation!

51
00:03:24,199 --> 00:03:26,080
If Shen Jialing can be a CEO,

52
00:03:26,800 --> 00:03:28,400
so can I, Zhou Qian!

53
00:03:38,439 --> 00:03:39,680
Stupid woman.

54
00:03:39,800 --> 00:03:41,280
If anything goes wrong with the company,

55
00:03:41,439 --> 00:03:44,080
you'll be my rightful scapegoat.

56
00:03:48,439 --> 00:03:49,000
Come.

57
00:03:49,879 --> 00:03:50,599
A toast to you.

58
00:03:52,080 --> 00:03:52,879
President Zhou.

59
00:03:54,240 --> 00:03:54,879
Thank you.

60
00:04:14,919 --> 00:04:16,800
It seems Second Uncle's constant warnings

61
00:04:16,920 --> 00:04:18,079
were all because of Ma Dawei.

62
00:04:19,360 --> 00:04:20,279
I don't know why,

63
00:04:20,800 --> 00:04:22,000
but I can't just openly say

64
00:04:22,000 --> 00:04:23,480
there's nothing going on between us.

65
00:04:24,480 --> 00:04:25,560
Since we're destined

66
00:04:25,800 --> 00:04:27,519
not to take things any further,

67
00:04:27,879 --> 00:04:29,399
I should clear up this misunderstanding.

68
00:04:30,199 --> 00:04:32,120
Just let me crash for one more night!

69
00:04:33,360 --> 00:04:34,439
Brother Dawei!

70
00:04:34,720 --> 00:04:36,519
Master Ma! Stock God!

71
00:04:38,160 --> 00:04:39,240
Your timing on buying the dip yesterday,

72
00:04:39,240 --> 00:04:40,639
how on earth did you spot it?

73
00:04:40,639 --> 00:04:42,240
Just teach me, please!

74
00:04:43,519 --> 00:04:44,519
With that weak pressure,

75
00:04:44,519 --> 00:04:45,680
didn't you eat anything?

76
00:04:46,399 --> 00:04:48,199
If you want to learn from me,

77
00:04:48,199 --> 00:04:50,079
you need to show some real sincerity.

78
00:04:50,759 --> 00:04:52,680
Quit keeping me in suspense!

79
00:04:53,360 --> 00:04:54,240
Last night,

80
00:04:54,480 --> 00:04:56,399
I watched US stocks in your bed all night!

81
00:04:56,639 --> 00:04:58,199
I've even got dark circles now!

82
00:05:00,720 --> 00:05:01,519
Sister Yi?

83
00:05:01,680 --> 00:05:02,639
What are you doing here?

84
00:05:02,639 --> 00:05:03,680
Your lover?

85
00:05:07,040 --> 00:05:08,040
Well, what do you know?

86
00:05:08,279 --> 00:05:10,439
Boss Ma not only fleeces retail investors,

87
00:05:10,639 --> 00:05:11,920
late at night at home,

88
00:05:11,920 --> 00:05:13,600
he even runs tutoring sessions.

89
00:05:14,279 --> 00:05:14,879
What?

90
00:05:15,079 --> 00:05:16,360
Learning to trade stocks these days

91
00:05:16,680 --> 00:05:18,000
has to be done in bed now?

92
00:05:20,120 --> 00:05:21,759
What nonsense are you talking about?

93
00:05:21,959 --> 00:05:23,680
We were genuinely analyzing the market!

94
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:24,480
Last night,

95
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:25,959
Brother Dawei gave up his bed for me,

96
00:05:25,959 --> 00:05:27,120
and slept on the floor himself!

97
00:05:27,519 --> 00:05:28,959
What a dirty mind you have!

98
00:05:29,079 --> 00:05:30,319
"Genuinely analyzing the market"?

99
00:05:30,319 --> 00:05:31,399
Does that really need to be done in bed?

100
00:05:31,720 --> 00:05:32,000
Well...

101
00:05:32,000 --> 00:05:32,680
Dawei,

102
00:05:33,600 --> 00:05:35,399
why didn't you tell me we had a guest?

103
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:37,720
And this is...?

104
00:05:37,720 --> 00:05:38,959
And who are you?

105
00:05:38,959 --> 00:05:39,720
Sister-in-law,

106
00:05:39,959 --> 00:05:41,560
this is my business partner,

107
00:05:41,560 --> 00:05:42,160
Shen Yiyi.

108
00:05:42,959 --> 00:05:43,439
Sis—

109
00:05:45,000 --> 00:05:46,000
Hello, Sister-in-law.

110
00:05:46,120 --> 00:05:47,720
I've heard Dawei mention you often.

111
00:05:48,000 --> 00:05:49,360
He said not only are you gorgeous,

112
00:05:49,480 --> 00:05:50,480
but your cooking is also incredible.

113
00:05:50,920 --> 00:05:52,120
Forgive my unannounced visit today.

114
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:52,839
Sorry for intruding.

115
00:05:53,720 --> 00:05:54,279
Oh, right.

116
00:05:54,480 --> 00:05:56,399
I didn't bring much for our first meeting.

117
00:05:56,759 --> 00:05:57,839
This is an annual VIP card

118
00:05:57,839 --> 00:05:59,600
for a new downtown luxury beauty salon.

119
00:05:59,959 --> 00:06:01,800
You work so hard running the household,

120
00:06:01,800 --> 00:06:03,199
you really need to pamper yourself more.

121
00:06:03,279 --> 00:06:04,639
Feel free to use it whenever you like.

122
00:06:04,759 --> 00:06:05,839
It's all on my tab.

123
00:06:05,879 --> 00:06:06,360
Oh, this...

124
00:06:06,720 --> 00:06:08,319
I really couldn't!

125
00:06:08,800 --> 00:06:10,079
This must cost tens of thousands!

126
00:06:10,279 --> 00:06:11,399
It's really not much.

127
00:06:11,600 --> 00:06:12,639
Please keep it, Sister-in-law.

128
00:06:12,959 --> 00:06:13,959
As long as it makes you happy.

129
00:06:15,399 --> 00:06:17,439
Yiyi, you're not just beautiful,

130
00:06:17,439 --> 00:06:18,439
you're so sweet-tongued too!

131
00:06:18,519 --> 00:06:19,399
Come, have a seat!

132
00:06:20,240 --> 00:06:21,639
You must stay for lunch today.

133
00:06:21,720 --> 00:06:22,519
I'll cook for you!

134
00:06:39,399 --> 00:06:40,120
Yiyi,

135
00:06:40,399 --> 00:06:41,639
are you married yet?

136
00:06:42,439 --> 00:06:43,920
What's so great about beauty salons?

137
00:06:44,079 --> 00:06:44,680
Sister-in-law,

138
00:06:45,120 --> 00:06:46,040
let me rub your shoulders.

139
00:06:47,480 --> 00:06:48,600
Unlike some people,

140
00:06:48,800 --> 00:06:51,120
showing off with their bit of money,

141
00:06:51,800 --> 00:06:53,920
they don't know the simple joys of life.

142
00:06:53,920 --> 00:06:54,399
Right?

143
00:06:54,480 --> 00:06:55,639
They don't know how to live.

144
00:06:55,800 --> 00:06:57,399
Dawei would never like someone like that.

145
00:06:59,079 --> 00:07:00,079
Having money

146
00:07:00,240 --> 00:07:02,800
lets you enjoy life's simple pleasures.

147
00:07:03,000 --> 00:07:04,600
What do you know, little girl?

148
00:07:04,600 --> 00:07:05,800
What are you acting so smug about?

149
00:07:05,800 --> 00:07:06,959
You old woman!

150
00:07:08,720 --> 00:07:10,120
Old woman?

151
00:07:11,160 --> 00:07:12,120
A woman in her thirties

152
00:07:12,120 --> 00:07:13,920
is in her prime, with looks and money.

153
00:07:13,920 --> 00:07:14,800
Unlike you,

154
00:07:15,360 --> 00:07:17,319
an underdeveloped brat.

155
00:07:18,800 --> 00:07:20,319
Who are you calling underdeveloped?

156
00:07:20,399 --> 00:07:21,000
Who, you ask?

157
00:07:21,319 --> 00:07:22,519
Whoever's getting mad!

158
00:07:23,199 --> 00:07:23,680
You...

159
00:07:24,000 --> 00:07:24,600
You!

160
00:07:27,399 --> 00:07:29,839
Sister-in-law, look at her!

161
00:07:29,959 --> 00:07:31,199
How can she talk like that?

162
00:07:31,199 --> 00:07:31,920
All right, that's enough.

163
00:07:32,360 --> 00:07:33,600
Hello, Second Uncle.

164
00:07:34,560 --> 00:07:35,800
I'm at the International Hotel.

165
00:07:36,000 --> 00:07:37,439
I set up a meeting for you two.

166
00:07:38,040 --> 00:07:39,160
Clean yourself up

167
00:07:39,680 --> 00:07:40,959
and head over right now.

168
00:07:43,959 --> 00:07:45,000
We clearly agreed

169
00:07:45,279 --> 00:07:47,480
to keep our distance after coming clean,

170
00:07:48,439 --> 00:07:49,600
yet over him,

171
00:07:49,600 --> 00:07:51,560
I ended up bickering with a little girl.

172
00:07:55,079 --> 00:07:55,680
Yiyi,

173
00:07:55,839 --> 00:07:56,480
what would you like to eat?

174
00:07:56,480 --> 00:07:57,600
I'll make it right now.

175
00:07:58,879 --> 00:07:59,959
Don't bother, Sister-in-law.

176
00:08:00,240 --> 00:08:01,879
I have an emergency at home and must go.

177
00:08:03,000 --> 00:08:03,800
Ma Dawei.

178
00:08:08,199 --> 00:08:10,000
Forget it, we'll talk later.

179
00:08:12,160 --> 00:08:12,959
Talk about what?

180
00:08:15,759 --> 00:08:17,399
What did she come here for today?

181
00:08:20,639 --> 00:08:21,279
Dawei,

182
00:08:22,199 --> 00:08:24,000
Yiyi is such a pretty girl.

183
00:08:24,600 --> 00:08:26,240
She hardly seems from an ordinary family.

184
00:08:27,439 --> 00:08:28,720
Is there something going on between you?

185
00:08:30,720 --> 00:08:32,080
What are you saying, Sister-in-law?

186
00:08:32,080 --> 00:08:33,039
She already has a boyfriend.

187
00:08:35,000 --> 00:08:35,879
By the way, Sister-in-law,

188
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:37,399
don't make lunch for me today.

189
00:08:37,399 --> 00:08:38,639
Where are you going? Where are you going?

190
00:08:39,399 --> 00:08:40,759
It's that Uncle Xu again.

191
00:08:40,960 --> 00:08:42,360
He insisted on dragging me out to lunch.

192
00:08:42,679 --> 00:08:43,879
He probably wants to

193
00:08:43,879 --> 00:08:45,440
take his older, divorced niece,

194
00:08:45,559 --> 00:08:47,080
who even kept a toy boy,

195
00:08:47,080 --> 00:08:47,960
and set her up with me.

196
00:08:48,320 --> 00:08:49,200
What?

197
00:08:49,519 --> 00:08:50,279
Brother Dawei,

198
00:08:50,279 --> 00:08:52,360
how could that old woman deserve you?

199
00:08:52,519 --> 00:08:53,240
Don't worry.

200
00:08:53,919 --> 00:08:55,720
Even if I, Ma Dawei, stay single for life,

201
00:08:56,480 --> 00:08:58,000
or jump off the bridge on Old Street,

202
00:08:58,200 --> 00:08:59,399
I'll never be

203
00:08:59,399 --> 00:09:00,399
that old woman's fall guy.

204
00:09:02,279 --> 00:09:03,200
I'm going today

205
00:09:03,759 --> 00:09:04,960
just to flip the table on them.

206
00:09:37,600 --> 00:09:38,159
Second Uncle.

207
00:09:38,279 --> 00:09:38,720
Sit.

208
00:09:41,919 --> 00:09:43,360
I said all I needed to say last time.

209
00:09:43,519 --> 00:09:44,399
When that big shot arrives,

210
00:09:44,399 --> 00:09:45,200
you'd better make the most of it.

211
00:09:46,120 --> 00:09:46,879
Second Uncle...

212
00:09:47,200 --> 00:09:49,000
Is there really no other way?

213
00:09:49,000 --> 00:09:50,039
This isn't a request.

214
00:09:50,279 --> 00:09:51,159
It's an order.

215
00:09:53,039 --> 00:09:53,720
Jialing,

216
00:09:54,200 --> 00:09:56,240
I treat you like my own niece.

217
00:09:56,480 --> 00:09:58,080
I wouldn't pick the wrong man for you.

218
00:09:59,799 --> 00:10:00,600
Uncle,

219
00:10:01,840 --> 00:10:04,360
I came out of respect for you as an elder,

220
00:10:04,360 --> 00:10:06,279
but your niece and I aren't a match.

221
00:10:06,879 --> 00:10:08,600
The man Second Uncle chose...

222
00:10:08,600 --> 00:10:10,039
is actually Ma Dawei?!
